{"sessionId":"flatspace-cleanup-sess-1787229185","message":"security: strip HiddenSpawn malware payload from tailwind.config.mjs, restore .env to gitignore\n\nThe prior commit 6afa634 (\"security: remove HiddenSpawn malware\npayload\") did not remove the payload; it left the file at 32951\nbytes/24 lines with the injected ETH-RPC-C2 dropper still appended\nafter the legitimate export default block. This commit restores the\nfile to its clean, pre-injection content (verified against every\nprior commit on main, all of which carried a 562-byte clean version)\nand re-adds .env to .gitignore, which the injecting commit 502a5ba\n(an automated github-actions[bot] version-bump commit) had dropped."}